   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PMU humanit&#xe4;rt program i DRC 2009-2011.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PMU-InterLife&apos;s humanitarian programme 2009-2011 in South Kivu (DR    Congo), including 5 components: 1. resttlement, 2. nutrition / food   security, 3. hospital rehabilitation (Lemera), 4. SGBV project (Panzi hospital), and 5. quality management: duration 27 months, starting    March 2009 to May 2011. Funding from Sida is 22.6 MSEK, ECHO co-funds comp. 4 (Panzi) with 450,000 &#x20ac;; PMU completes funding with 1.5 MSEK</narrative>
